    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43531" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sēmĭ-pĕdālis</span></b> ,
		e, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a half-foot in size</i>, <i>half
				a foot long</i>, <i>broad</i>, etc.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">apertura,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					10, 19</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Col. 11, 3, 21</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spatium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					12, 52, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">altitudo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					26, 8, 42, § 69</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">truncus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					13, 4, 8, § 37</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pisciculus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 32,
					1, 1, § 3</span></i>
			; cf. the foll. art.</div>
